#. Translators: The title of the AutoMaximize category in NVDA's Settings dialog.
msgid "AutoMaximize"
msgstr "AutoMaximize"

#. Translators: Label for a checkbox in the AutoMaximize settings panel.
msgid "Automatically maximize standard application &windows"
msgstr "Automatically maximize standard application &windows"

#. Translators: Label for a checkbox in the AutoMaximize settings panel.
msgid "Automatically maximize &dialog windows"
msgstr "Automatically maximize &dialog windows"

#. Translators: Description of the toggle command shown in Input Gestures.
msgid "Toggles automatic window maximization on or off"
msgstr "Toggles automatic window maximization on or off"

#. Translators: Announced when the toggle turns the feature on.
msgid "Automatic window maximization enabled"
msgstr "Automatic window maximization enabled"

#. Translators: Announced when the toggle turns the feature off.
msgid "Automatic window maximization disabled"
msgstr "Automatic window maximization disabled"
